  "goodToKnow": "Das Menschenleben means human life, often counted in reports of disasters: Das Erdbeben forderte Tausende Menschenleben (claimed thousands of lives). Menschenleben retten means to save lives. It can also mean a lifetime: ein ganzes Menschenleben lang. In 2006 the Constitutional Court ruled that the state may not shoot down a hijacked plane, as human lives cannot be weighed against each other. The plural is unchanged."
